 "title_en": "Prophets and Kings of Judah and of Israel",
 "title_ta": "யூதாவிலும் இஸ்ரவேலிலும் இருந்த தீர்க்கதரிசிகள் மற்றும் ராஜாக்கள்",
 "kind": "chart_reproduction",
 "description_en": "NWT Appendix A6 (parts A and B) sets the kings of the southern two-tribe kingdom of Judah and of the northern ten-tribe kingdom of Israel side by side from the division of the kingdom in 997 B.C.E., with the accession year and length of each reign, and draws the prophets who served during that time between the two columns. Part B ends with Assyria’s conquest of Samaria (740 B.C.E.) and the destruction of Jerusalem and dethroning of Zedekiah (607 B.C.E.).",
 "description_ta": null,
