 ],
 "notes": "Members are ordered as the chart lists them: Judah column, Israel column, then the chart’s ‘List of Prophets’ (A6-A, then A6-B). Reigns are the derived reign spans d1-0032…d1-0070 (start at the printed accession year; end at the next accession, as A6 lays them out). A6 draws the prophets as bars without printed years; the prophets’ dates in the member records come from their other jw.org sources (Insight, ‘All Scripture’, Table of the Books). Audit 2026-10-12: every king, prophet and printed year on A6-A/A6-B is represented; the only printed date that had no record (Zechariah’s kingship confirmed c. 792) was added as b16-0001."
}